'''Mat Lucas''' is a voice actor who voiced [[Anakin Skywalker/Legends|Anakin Skywalker]] in ''[[Star Wars: Clone Wars]]'' and a few ''Star Wars ''video games. He is considered an "audio double" of [[Hayden Christensen]]. He also has done editing and other film-related tasks at AFI. Mat has stated that he hopes to do more voice-overs in the future. Despite this, he would be replaced by [[Matt Lanter]], who voiced the character onward.

Mat Lucas was originally going to voice [[Anakin Skywalker/Legends|Anakin]] in the 2008 show [[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]] as well, and even recorded his lines for the first 6 episodes. However, he was later replaced by [[Matt Lanter]].<ref name="FSF Podcast">{{YouTube|video=7PM2A1hkkTc|text=The 2D Anakin ft. Mat Lucas|channel=@fsfpopcast|name=The FSF PopCast|date=2024-01-05}}</ref>

